<title>SOUTH KOREA: Korea Flour seeks 17,300 tonnes of U.S. wheat.</title>
<headline>Korea Flour seeks 17,300 tonnes of U.S. wheat.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Korea Flour Milling Corp on Wednesday invited tenders for 17,300 tonnes of U.S. No.1 wheat by 2.00 p.m. (0500 GMT), an offical with Korea Flour said.</p>
<p>The official said shipment was set for March 1-31 from the Pacific Northwest to the western port city of Mokpo.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
</text>
